<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav November wages fall 1.4 pct to 787 dinars.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav November wages fall 1.4 pct to 787 dinars.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV AVERAGE NET WAGES  Nov 96     Oct 96     Nov 95</p>
<p> wage in dinars		    787	  798	  421</p>
<p> mth/mth pct change	     -1.4	+12.9	 +7.0</p>
<p>NOTE -- Data do not include private sector.</p>
<p>($1=5.12 dinars)</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 2224305</p>
</text>
